@startuml github-call-deadline
' cumin works - every call of the GitHub client ends after a deadline.
' Document: cumin-core.md, topic on the GitHub client.
' Render: run scripts/render-diagrams.sh at the root of the repository.
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName sans-serif

rectangle "cumin run\n(poll, actions)" as run
rectangle "cumin status" as status
rectangle "cumin setup" as setup
rectangle "AppClient\ninternal/platform/github\nREST and GraphQL" as client
cloud "GitHub API" as api

run --> client
status --> client
setup --> client
client -[#red,bold]-> api : <color:red>every call ends\n<color:red>after 30 seconds</color>

note right of client
  A call that gets no answer
  returns an error at the deadline.
  The poll logs it and runs again
  at the next interval.
end note
@enduml
